      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HI ELLEN (1) is a good beginner but will need a quick break. Last start finished 6th over 300m at this track beaten 5.5 lengths (17.26) behind Chad's Girl in a Grade 4/5 on July 23. Looks hard to beat with even luck. LADY BLAZINGTON (3) turned in a better run last time to find a minor placing (17.27) at this track behind Martinique in a Grade 5. Has the pace to be prominent. Has never been out of the placings from two starts out of this box. Leading player again. KINGSBRAE EBANEE (2) returned a better run last time, finishing in the money (17.23) at this track behind Martinique in a Grade 5. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. Won at her only start from this box. Expected to be in this for a long way. LITTLE DULCIE (8) is fresh from a short break and ready to run well.",
